@* Illustrated tour (site.js initOnboarding): one slide per setup step, each with an inline SVG that follows the color
   mode through the Bootstrap/--app-* variables. Opened from the sidebar button "Panduan memulai" or the Setup page; the
   steps themselves are done on the Setup page, which the slide buttons link to. *@
<div class="modal fade" id="onboardingModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="onboardingHeading" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content onboarding">
            <div class="modal-header win-bar border-0 pb-0">
                <win-controls for="modal" />
                <h5 class="modal-title fs-6 text-secondary fw-normal" id="onboardingHeading">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Panduan memulai · <span id=\"onboardingStep\">1 / 9</span>", "Getting started · <span id=\"onboardingStep\">1 / 9</span>"))</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body pt-2">
                <svg width="0" height="0" class="position-absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <defs>
                        <marker id="obArrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                            <path class="ob-arrowhead" d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" />
                        </marker>
                    </defs>
                </svg>

                <div id="onboardingCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-touch="true">
                    <div class="carousel-inner">

                        @* 1. What AIT is *@
                        <div class="carousel-item active">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Alur: Anda memakai CLI coding, CLI mengirim ke AIT; planner menyusun rencana, beberapa executor bekerja paralel, wrapper merangkum; semua model berasal dari 9router", "Flow: you use a coding CLI, the CLI sends to AIT; the planner makes a plan, several executors work in parallel, the wrapper summarizes; every model comes from 9router")">
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="8" y="88" width="72" height="54" rx="10" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="44" y="120" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Anda", "You")</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M82 115 H104" />
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="106" y="78" width="104" height="74" rx="10" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="158" y="104" text-anchor="middle">CLI coding</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="158" y="122" text-anchor="middle">Claude Code</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="158" y="137" text-anchor="middle">Codex · Gemini …</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M212 115 H234" />

                                    <rect class="ob-panel ob-accent-stroke" x="236" y="14" width="316" height="202" rx="14" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong ob-accent-text" x="252" y="38">AIT</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="282" y="38">@Lang.T("proxy + orkestrasi", "proxy + orchestration")</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M505 84 V58 H158 V76" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="330" y="53">@Lang.T("jawaban akhir", "final answer")</text>

                                    <rect class="ob-accent" x="252" y="86" width="82" height="50" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-on-accent ob-strong" x="293" y="108" text-anchor="middle">Planner</text>
                                    <text class="ob-on-accent ob-xs" x="293" y="124" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("rencana", "plan")</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M336 111 L360 78" />
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M336 111 H360" />
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M336 111 L360 144" />
                                    <rect class="ob-ok-soft" x="362" y="63" width="84" height="26" rx="6" />
                                    <rect class="ob-ok-soft" x="362" y="98" width="84" height="26" rx="6" />
                                    <rect class="ob-ok-soft" x="362" y="133" width="84" height="26" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="404" y="80" text-anchor="middle">Executor</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="404" y="115" text-anchor="middle">Executor</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="404" y="150" text-anchor="middle">Executor</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M448 76 L468 106" />
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M448 111 H468" />
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M448 146 L468 116" />
                                    <rect class="ob-warn" x="470" y="86" width="70" height="50" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-on-warn ob-strong" x="505" y="108" text-anchor="middle">Wrapper</text>
                                    <text class="ob-on-warn ob-xs" x="505" y="124" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("ringkas", "summary")</text>

                                    <path class="ob-dash" d="M293 136 V178 M404 159 V178 M505 136 V178" />
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="252" y="178" width="288" height="26" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="396" y="195" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("9router — semua model (Claude, GPT, Gemini, …)", "9router — every model (Claude, GPT, Gemini, …)")</text>
                                </svg>
                            </figure>
                            <h4 class="onboarding-title">@Lang.T("Selamat datang di AIT 👋", "Welcome to AIT 👋")</h4>
                            <p>
                                @Html.Raw(Lang.T("AIT duduk di antara CLI coding Anda dan 9router. Setiap perintah <strong>direncanakan</strong> oleh satu model kuat, <strong>dikerjakan paralel</strong> oleh banyak model murah, lalu <strong>dirangkum</strong> kembali ke CLI Anda — lebih cepat dan lebih hemat token.", "AIT sits between your coding CLI and 9router. Every command is <strong>planned</strong> by one strong model, <strong>done in parallel</strong> by many cheap models, then <strong>summarized</strong> back to your CLI — faster and with fewer tokens."))
                            </p>
                            <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">
                                @Lang.T("Panduan ini ±2 menit: pasang → hubungkan → pakai. Geser, klik titik di bawah, atau pakai tombol panah ← →. Langkah-langkahnya bisa langsung dikerjakan di satu halaman: menu", "This guide takes about 2 minutes: install → connect → use. Swipe, click the dots below, or use the ← → arrow keys. The steps can be done right away on one page: the menu") <a asp-controller="Setup" asp-action="Index">Setup</a>.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        @* 2. Install *@
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Terminal PowerShell: npm i -g aithread lalu aithread tray; AIT berjalan di localhost:5225 dengan ikon di tray Windows", "PowerShell terminal: npm i -g aithread then aithread tray; AIT runs on localhost:5225 with an icon in the Windows tray")">
                                    <rect class="ob-term" x="16" y="14" width="404" height="202" rx="10" />
                                    <path class="ob-term-bar" d="M16 24 a10 10 0 0 1 10 -10 H410 a10 10 0 0 1 10 10 V40 H16 z" />
                                    <circle cx="34" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#e5534b" />
                                    <circle cx="48" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#f0ad3c" />
                                    <circle cx="62" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#2fbf71" />
                                    <text class="ob-term-m ob-sm" x="218" y="31" text-anchor="middle">PowerShell</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-t ob-mono" x="30" y="68"><tspan class="ob-term-p">PS&gt;</tspan> npm i -g aithread</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-m ob-mono" x="30" y="90">added 2 packages in 9s</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-t ob-mono" x="30" y="120"><tspan class="ob-term-p">PS&gt;</tspan> aithread tray</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-ok ob-mono" x="30" y="142">@Lang.T("✓ AIT berjalan di http://localhost:5225", "✓ AIT running at http://localhost:5225")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-m ob-mono" x="30" y="164">  @Lang.T("ikon AIT muncul di tray Windows", "the AIT icon shows up in the Windows tray")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-t ob-mono" x="30" y="194"><tspan class="ob-term-p">PS&gt;</tspan></text>
                                    <rect class="ob-cursor" x="64" y="183" width="8" height="15" />

                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="436" y="96" width="110" height="120" rx="10" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="491" y="118" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Tray Windows", "Windows tray")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="452" y="132" width="22" height="22" rx="5" />
                                    <image href="@Url.Content("~/img/aithread.svg")" x="480" y="129" width="28" height="28" />
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="514" y="132" width="22" height="22" rx="5" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="491" y="180" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Klik kanan:", "Right-click:")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="491" y="197" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("buka / stop", "open / stop")</text>
                                </svg>
                            </figure>
                            <h4 class="onboarding-title">@Lang.T("1. Pasang dan jalankan AIT", "1. Install and start AIT")</h4>
                            <p>
                                @Html.Raw(Lang.T("Butuh <strong>Windows x64</strong>, <strong>Node.js</strong>, dan <strong>SQL Server LocalDB</strong> (ikut terpasang bersama Visual Studio atau SQL Server Express). Lalu di PowerShell:", "Needs <strong>Windows x64</strong>, <strong>Node.js</strong> and <strong>SQL Server LocalDB</strong> (installed along with Visual Studio or SQL Server Express). Then in PowerShell:"))
                            </p>
                            <pre class="code-block small mb-2">npm i -g aithread
aithread tray        @Lang.T("# jalan di background, ikon di tray", "# runs in the background, icon in the tray")</pre>
                            <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Halaman ini sudah terbuka? Berarti langkah ini selesai. Perintah lain: <span class=\"mono\">aithread help</span>.", "Is this page open already? Then this step is done. Other commands: <span class=\"mono\">aithread help</span>."))</p>
                        </div>

                        @* 3. 9router *@
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Pasang 9router lewat npm, buka dashboard localhost:20128, hubungkan provider, salin API key", "Install 9router with npm, open the dashboard at localhost:20128, connect providers, copy the API key")">
                                    <rect class="ob-term" x="16" y="14" width="204" height="118" rx="10" />
                                    <path class="ob-term-bar" d="M16 24 a10 10 0 0 1 10 -10 H210 a10 10 0 0 1 10 10 V40 H16 z" />
                                    <circle cx="34" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#e5534b" />
                                    <circle cx="48" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#f0ad3c" />
                                    <circle cx="62" cy="27" r="4.5" fill="#2fbf71" />
                                    <text class="ob-term-t ob-mono ob-sm" x="28" y="66"><tspan class="ob-term-p">PS&gt;</tspan> npm i -g 9router</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-t ob-mono ob-sm" x="28" y="88"><tspan class="ob-term-p">PS&gt;</tspan> 9router</text>
                                    <text class="ob-term-ok ob-mono ob-sm" x="28" y="112">✓ dashboard :20128</text>
                                    <path class="ob-arrow" d="M118 136 V172 H226" />

                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="232" y="14" width="314" height="202" rx="10" />
                                    <path class="ob-soft" d="M232 24 a10 10 0 0 1 10 -10 H536 a10 10 0 0 1 10 10 V42 H232 z" />
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="290" y="20" width="200" height="16" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-m ob-mono" x="302" y="32">localhost:20128</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="248" y="64">Providers</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="248" y="74" width="282" height="30" rx="6" />
                                    <circle class="ob-ok" cx="262" cy="89" r="5" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="274" y="93">Anthropic</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="518" y="93" text-anchor="end">@Lang.T("terhubung", "connected")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="248" y="110" width="282" height="30" rx="6" />
                                    <circle class="ob-ok" cx="262" cy="125" r="5" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="274" y="129">@Lang.T("OpenRouter (gratis)", "OpenRouter (free)")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="518" y="129" text-anchor="end">@Lang.T("terhubung", "connected")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-panel ob-accent-stroke" x="248" y="152" width="282" height="48" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="260" y="170">API key</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-mono ob-sm" x="260" y="189">sk-9r-••••••••••</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-accent" x="462" y="164" width="56" height="24" rx="5" />
                                    <text class="ob-on-accent ob-sm" x="490" y="180" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Salin", "Copy")</text>
                                </svg>
                            </figure>
                            <h4 class="onboarding-title">@Lang.T("2. Siapkan 9router", "2. Prepare 9router")</h4>
                            <p>
                                @Html.Raw(Lang.T("9router adalah sumber semua model AI. Pasang dengan <span class=\"mono\">npm i -g 9router</span>, jalankan <span class=\"mono\">9router</span>, lalu di dashboard-nya hubungkan <strong>minimal satu provider</strong> (idealnya satu yang kuat dan satu yang murah/gratis) dan <strong>salin API key</strong>.", "9router is the source of every AI model. Install it with <span class=\"mono\">npm i -g 9router</span>, run <span class=\"mono\">9router</span>, then in its dashboard connect <strong>at least one provider</strong> (ideally a strong one and a cheap/free one) and <strong>copy the API key</strong>."))
                            </p>
                            <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="http://localhost:20128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@Lang.T("Buka dashboard 9router ↗", "Open the 9router dashboard ↗")</a>
                        </div>

                        @* 4. Setting *@
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Menu Pengaturan tab Koneksi 9router: isi URL dan API key, klik Test koneksi lalu Simpan; status berubah menjadi Terhubung", "Setting menu, 9router connection tab: fill in the URL and API key, click Test connection then Save; the status turns Connected")">
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="14" y="10" width="532" height="210" rx="10" />
                                    <path class="ob-soft" d="M14 20 a10 10 0 0 1 10 -10 H536 a10 10 0 0 1 10 10 V38 H14 z" />
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="160" y="16" width="240" height="16" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-m ob-mono" x="172" y="28">localhost:5225/Setting</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong ob-sm" x="32" y="62">@Lang.T("Koneksi 9router", "9router connection")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-accent" x="32" y="68" width="100" height="2.5" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="152" y="62">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Proxy &amp; orkestrasi", "Proxy &amp; orchestration"))</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="268" y="62">Build</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="312" y="62">@Lang.T("Memori", "Memory")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="366" y="62">Telegram</text>
                                    <path class="ob-line" d="M32 71 H528" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="32" y="94">URL 9router</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="32" y="100" width="300" height="28" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-mono ob-sm" x="42" y="118">http://localhost:20128</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="32" y="146">API key</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="32" y="152" width="300" height="28" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="42" y="171">••••••••••••••</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-panel ob-accent-stroke" x="32" y="190" width="104" height="24" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-accent-text ob-sm" x="84" y="206" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Test koneksi", "Test connection")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-accent" x="144" y="190" width="72" height="24" rx="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-on-accent ob-sm" x="180" y="206" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("Simpan", "Save")</text>

                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="354" y="100" width="174" height="80" rx="10" />
                                    <circle class="ob-ok" cx="374" cy="125" r="6" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="388" y="130">@Lang.T("Terhubung", "Connected")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="370" y="152">latency 12 ms</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="370" y="168">42 model · 3 combo</text>
                                </svg>
                            </figure>
                            <h4 class="onboarding-title">@Lang.T("3. Hubungkan AIT ke 9router", "3. Connect AIT to 9router")</h4>
                            <p>
                                @Html.Raw(Lang.T("Menu <strong>Penyiapan</strong> → langkah <em>Hubungkan 9router</em>: isi URL (default <span class=\"mono\">http://localhost:20128</span>) dan API key, lalu <strong>Test &amp; simpan</strong> (sekali klik). Pill status di kiri bawah sidebar berubah hijau. Pengaturan yang sama ada di Pengaturan → <em>Koneksi 9router</em>.", "The <strong>Setup</strong> menu → step <em>Connect 9router</em>: fill in the URL (default <span class=\"mono\">http://localhost:20128</span>) and the API key, then <strong>Test &amp; save</strong> (one click). The status pill at the bottom left of the sidebar turns green. The same settings are in Setting → <em>9router connection</em>."))
                            </p>
                            <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Setup" asp-action="Index" asp-fragment="step-router">@Lang.T("Kerjakan di Penyiapan →", "Do it in Setup →")</a>
                        </div>

                        @* 5. Nodes *@
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Menu Node dengan tiga kolom: satu Planner, dua Executor, satu Wrapper, dan Reviewer opsional", "Node menu with three columns: one Planner, two Executors, one Wrapper, and an optional Reviewer")">
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="14" y="12" width="168" height="206" rx="12" />
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="196" y="12" width="168" height="206" rx="12" />
                                    <rect class="ob-soft" x="378" y="12" width="168" height="206" rx="12" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="28" y="38">Planner</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="168" y="38" text-anchor="end">1 node</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="210" y="38">Executor</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="350" y="38" text-anchor="end">≥ 1 node</text>
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="392" y="38">Wrapper</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="532" y="38" text-anchor="end">1 node</text>

                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="28" y="52" width="140" height="66" rx="8" />
                                    <rect class="ob-accent" x="28" y="52" width="4" height="66" rx="2" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm ob-strong" x="42" y="74">@Lang.T("Model terkuat", "Strongest model")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="42" y="93">tool calling ✓</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="42" y="108">@Lang.T("menyusun rencana", "writes the plan")</text>

                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="210" y="52" width="140" height="66" rx="8" />
                                    <rect class="ob-ok" x="210" y="52" width="4" height="66" rx="2" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm ob-strong" x="224" y="74">Executor A</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="224" y="93">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("murah &amp; cepat", "cheap &amp; fast"))</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="224" y="108">@Lang.T("max paralel 4", "max parallel 4")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="210" y="126" width="140" height="66" rx="8" />
                                    <rect class="ob-ok" x="210" y="126" width="4" height="66" rx="2" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm ob-strong" x="224" y="148">Executor B</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="224" y="167">@Lang.T("provider lain", "another provider")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="224" y="182">@Lang.T("max paralel 4", "max parallel 4")</text>

                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="392" y="52" width="140" height="66" rx="8" />
                                    <rect class="ob-warn" x="392" y="52" width="4" height="66" rx="2" />
                                    <text class="ob-t ob-sm ob-strong" x="406" y="74">@Lang.T("Model murah", "Cheap model")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="406" y="93">@Lang.T("merangkum hasil", "summarizes the results")</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="406" y="108">@Lang.T("+ ekstraksi memory", "+ memory extraction")</text>
                                    <rect class="ob-dashed" x="392" y="126" width="140" height="66" rx="8" />
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="462" y="155" text-anchor="middle">+ Reviewer</text>
                                    <text class="ob-m" x="462" y="171" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("(opsional)", "(optional)")</text>
                                </svg>
                            </figure>
                            <h4 class="onboarding-title">@Lang.T("4. Pilih model untuk tiap peran", "4. Choose a model for each role")</h4>
                            <p>
                                @Html.Raw(Lang.T("Paling cepat: menu <strong>Penyiapan</strong> → pilih <strong>model kuat</strong> (planner, mendukung tool calling) dan <strong>model murah</strong> (executor, wrapper, dll.). AIT membuat node tiap peran dan langsung mengujinya. Detail per node (Reviewer, executor tambahan, node cadangan, skill) diatur di menu <strong>Node</strong>.", "Fastest: the <strong>Setup</strong> menu → choose a <strong>strong model</strong> (the planner, with tool calling) and a <strong>cheap model</strong> (executor, wrapper, etc.). AIT creates a node per role and tests it right away. Details per node (Reviewer, extra executors, fallback nodes, skills) are set in the <strong>Node</strong> menu."))
                            </p>
                            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Setup" asp-action="Index" asp-fragment="step-nodes">@Lang.T("Kerjakan di Penyiapan →", "Do it in Setup →")</a>
                                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" asp-controller="Node" asp-action="Index">@Lang.T("Buka Node", "Open Node")</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        @* 6. Projects *@
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                                <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 230" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Menu Project: satu project terdaftar otomatis dari sesi CLI, dua lainnya lewat tombol Telusuri; stack tiap folder terdeteksi", "Project menu: one project registered automatically from a CLI session, two more through the Browse button; the stack of each folder is detected")">
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="14" y="10" width="532" height="210" rx="10" />
                                    <path class="ob-soft" d="M14 20 a10 10 0 0 1 10 -10 H536 a10 10 0 0 1 10 10 V38 H14 z" />
                                    <rect class="ob-panel" x="160" y="16" width="240" height="16" rx="8" />
